    "priority": 1,
    "summary": "Karnataka Examinations Authority (KEA) has released the revised provisional fee structure for 2026-27. Government engineering seats are set at ₹47,100 (₹29,985 for Mechanical/Civil/Textile/Auto), Type-1 unaided at ₹1,20,320, Type-2 unaided at ₹1,30,320, and SNQ quota engineering fees at ₹17,910 to ₹32,320. Full category-wise waivers for SC/ST and Category-1 are now available on the KCET Coded Fee Calculator."
